From 390fc223f8722dfac090bf74b25f422e21b8d401 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Khaled <khaledchoucri@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 21:16:24 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] POC-6: chain payoffs - Program Advances and contest-combo
 rewards

- 19 Program Advances: three recipe chips, consecutive and in order in one Custom selection,
  become one new move when the Custom closes (recipes: tools/lanes_curated.py; how each plays:
  tools/attacks_curated.py PA_EFFECTS -> move_table.c). The payoff chip's Pokemon performs it
  (benched ones switch in); each recipe chip spends its PP.
- New kind SWEEP (Mega Solar Beam): the enemy area is marked, then swept row by row.
- PA extras: forced crits, 100% status, drain / party heal, cracked or poison panels left behind.
- Contest combos (Emerald AreMovesContestCombo) between consecutive chips of one chain pay off:
  x1.5 damage, side effect always happens, and the follow-up's type changes the target's panel
  (cracked / poison / grass / ice / holy). PKBN_COMBO=dmg,effect,panel selects the rewards.
- BN6 ice panel: non-Water Pokemon slide.
- Self-test helpers: PKBN_NO_SHUFFLE, PKBN_TEST_PICKS.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FbWSqvcg6G5Gpw6ynvR5tJ
